      "params": [
        {
          "key": "size",
          "label": { "zh": "尺寸", "en": "Size" },
          "control": "select",
          "allowed": ["1K", "1.5K", "2K"],
          "allow_custom": false,
          "default": "2K",
          "source": "documented",
          "overrides": {
            "layer_decomposition": { "allowed": ["1K", "1.5K", "2K", "auto"], "default": "auto" }
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "layer_decomposition",
          "label": { "zh": "图层拆分", "en": "Layer decomposition" },
          "control": "switch",
          "default": false,
          "source": "measured",
          "when": { "all": [{ "request": "reference_count", "eq": 1 }] }
        },
        {
          "key": "output_format",
          "label": { "zh": "输出格式", "en": "Output format" },
          "control": "select",
          "allowed": ["png", "jpeg"],
          "default": "png",
          "source": "documented"
        },
        {
          "key": "background",
          "label": { "zh": "图片透明通道", "en": "Transparent background" },
          "control": "select",
          "allowed": ["opaque", "transparent"],
          "default": "opaque",
          "source": "documented",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              { "param": "output_format", "not_in": ["jpeg"] },
              { "request": "reference_count", "eq": 1 },
              { "request": "reference_has_alpha", "eq": true }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "watermark",
          "label": { "zh": "水印", "en": "Watermark" },
          "control": "switch",
          "default": false,
          "source": "documented"
        },
        {
          "key": "optimize_prompt_options.mode",
          "label": { "zh": "提示词优化档位", "en": "Prompt optimization" },
          "control": "select",
          "allowed": ["standard", "fast"],
          "default": "standard",
          "source": "documented"
        },
        {
          "key": "response_format",
          "label": { "zh": "返回格式", "en": "Response format" },
          "control": "select",
          "allowed": ["url", "b64_json"],
          "default": "url",
          "source": "documented"
        }
      ]
    },
    "status": 0,
    "remark": "模型标识为占位提示（Agent Plan 与标准 API 的写法不同，以实际入口为准）。能力声明按上游文档预置，管理员可改。水印：上游默认加水印，此处默认 false 是产品选择（ADR-0008），未显式传会被上游按 true 处理，因此默认值必须由服务端补齐。layer_decomposition 标 measured：已在 /api/plan/v3 上实测确认被接受；background 按文档声明为 opaque/transparent 字符串，布尔值已实测会被拒绝；本 seed 的 model_id 亦经实测可用。response_format 的 b64_json 取值与 optimize_prompt_options.mode 的 standard 默认档位同批实测确认。"
